WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A plugin packages reusable instructions, tool connections, or both.
It does not add a new AI model.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Directory: distribution. Host: skills and tools. Service: authorized data.
A listing does not grant account access.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Choose the smallest route: normal prompt, skill, or tool connection.
Start with readable inputs and an output you can check.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Check the host, account, permissions and costs.
Access rules may differ between surfaces.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Meeting Evidence 0.1.0: a manifest and a skill for supplied notes.
Static checks passed; installation and behavior are untested.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Static checks, behavior tests, submission and review, then Publish.
A correct ZIP does not prove a working or published plugin.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Start with the guide. Sources and full transcript are below the player.
No plugin installation or invocation is shown.
